<title>GREECE: RECORD ELECTION HITS ON DELTA INFORM'S WEB SITE.</title>
<headline>RECORD ELECTION HITS ON DELTA INFORM'S WEB SITE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's snap elections prompted a record 1,441,795 hits on Delta Informatic's web site coming from 24 countries, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The number sets a record in Greece's Internet. Just on election day, there were 864,049 hits when Yahoo, perhaps the world's most popular web site averages a daily 500,000-700,000 hits,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Delta Informatics is a subsidiary of Alpha Credit Bank. Its web site address is http://www.delta-inf.gr.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
